"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Note: </span>You can also do these steps yourself by using a MySQL administrator tool.</p>\n"
